{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 36, :comments ["<b>Return, YHWH.</b> Menachem explained it as a term of rest, as in ״בְּשׁוּבָה וָנַחַת תִּוָּשֵׁעוּן״ (Isaiah 30)." "<b>Ten thousands of thousands of Israel.</b> This teaches that the Shechinah does not rest upon Israel when they are fewer than two thousand and two ten-thousands (Yevamot 64)."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:10:16.121270671Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}